  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.15: PDF rendering fixes. #50: tables using row/column spans now get correct, span-aware column widths instead of starving a column or over-shrinking to micro-text. #51: table-of-contents page numbers right-align at the same margin regardless of nesting depth. #52: special/Unicode characters (✓, arrows incl. ⇒/⇐, bullets, geometric and math symbols) now render with an embedded Unicode fallback font (DejaVu Sans) plus a ToUnicode CMap, so they render portably and stay selectable/searchable instead of becoming '?'; the font is subset and embedded only when used (ASCII-only output unchanged). See CHANGELOG.md.",
